{"id":"bf50594cf0328bc9","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-weak-kleene.md","title":"弱Kleene逻辑","display":"df-weak-kleene — 弱Kleene逻辑","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-weak-kleene","aliases":["91-df-weak-kleene","91-df-weak-Kleene-logic"],"display":"df-weak-kleene — 弱Kleene逻辑","depends_on":["[[91-df-strong-kleene]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-weak-kleene"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-weak-kleene</span><span>91-df-weak-Kleene-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-kleene — 弱Kleene逻辑"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-weak-kleene-—-弱Kleene逻辑-$\\mathrm{LK}_w$\">df-weak-kleene — 弱Kleene逻辑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}_w\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}_w\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (带真理谓词的语言)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}\">\\(\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{t}\">\\(&lt;_{t}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\">\\(\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\)</span> (三值集、真值序和强 Kleene 否定,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为候选评估图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WK}_3(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{WK}_3(v)\\)</span> 是下述定义的一元弱 Kleene 评估谓词，语言固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WK}\">\\(\\mathrm{WK}\\)</span> 同时标明下述传播未定值的三值运算。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>先对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbf 3\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbf 3\\)</span> 及非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbf 3\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbf 3\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{\\mathrm{WK}}a\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}a,\n\\qquad\na\\land_{\\mathrm{WK}}b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\min_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\},&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin\\{a,b\\},\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{\\mathrm{WK}}a\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}a,\n\\qquad\na\\land_{\\mathrm{WK}}b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\min_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\},&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin\\{a,b\\},\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\lor_{\\mathrm{WK}}b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\max_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\},&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin\\{a,b\\},\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\lor_{\\mathrm{WK}}b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\max_{&lt;_{t}}\\{a,b\\},&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin\\{a,b\\},\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}A\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in A,\\\\\n\\min_{&lt;_{t}}A,&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin A,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\bigvee\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}A\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in A,\\\\\n\\max_{&lt;_{t}}A,&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin A.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}A\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in A,\\\\\n\\min_{&lt;_{t}}A,&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin A,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\bigvee\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}A\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&amp;\\mathbf u\\in A,\\\\\n\\max_{&lt;_{t}}A,&amp;\\mathbf u\\notin A.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WK}_3(v)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\nv:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\\nv(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\nv(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=\nv(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\psi)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nv(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\bigwedge\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}\n\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\\nv(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\bigvee\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}\n\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WK}_3(v)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\nv:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\\nv(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\nv(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=\nv(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\psi)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nv(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\bigwedge\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}\n\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\\nv(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\bigvee\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}\n\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WK}_3\">\\(\\mathrm{WK}_3\\)</span>：弱 Kleene 逻辑</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span>：未定义真值</li>\n</ul>\n<p>弱Kleene逻辑的含义：\n弱Kleene逻辑规定：若任一分量取值<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，则整个公式取值<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>弱Kleene vs 强Kleene：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运算</th>\n<th>弱Kleene</th>\n<th>强Kleene</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\\land\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf f\\land\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\\lor\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf t\\lor\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\\land\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf t\\land\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\\lor\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf f\\lor\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>关键区别不是只在析取：弱 Kleene 的所有复合联结词都传播未定义值，而强 Kleene 在另一输入已经决定结果时可输出确定值。</p>\n<p>弱Kleene的特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>间隙传播更快（一旦出现<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>，整体<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>更保守的推理规则</li>\n<li>不满足某些经典等价式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>弱Kleene在真理理论中的应用：\n弱Kleene逻辑较少用于真理公理化，因为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>弱Kleene不支持部分经典推理</li>\n<li>弱Kleene的传播规则过于严格</li>\n<li>强Kleene更常用于固定点构造</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-weak-kleene-—-弱Kleene逻辑-$\\mathrm{LK}_w$","text":"df-weak-kleene — 弱Kleene逻辑 $\\mathrm{LK}_w$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}$、$<_{t}$ 与\n$\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}$ (三值集、真值序和强 Kleene 否定,\nsee [[91-df-strong-kleene]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LK}_w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 3=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u,\\mathbf t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{t}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WK}_3(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WK}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbf 3","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_{\\mathrm{WK}}a\\coloneqq\\neg_{\\mathrm{SK}}a,\n\\qquad\na\\land_{\\mathrm{WK}}b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&\\mathbf u\\in\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\min_{<_{t}}\\{a,b\\},&\\mathbf u\\notin\\{a,b\\},\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"a\\lor_{\\mathrm{WK}}b\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&\\mathbf u\\in\\{a,b\\},\\\\\n\\max_{<_{t}}\\{a,b\\},&\\mathbf u\\notin\\{a,b\\},\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigwedge\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}A\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&\\mathbf u\\in A,\\\\\n\\min_{<_{t}}A,&\\mathbf u\\notin A,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\n\\bigvee\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}A\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf u,&\\mathbf u\\in A,\\\\\n\\max_{<_{t}}A,&\\mathbf u\\notin A.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}kleene}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WK}_3(v)\\coloneqq{}&\nv:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbf 3\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nv(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\\nv(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\nv(\\varphi)\\land_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\psi)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}\\land\\\nv(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)=\nv(\\varphi)\\lor_{\\mathrm{WK}}v(\\psi)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\\,\n\\Bigl(\nv(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\bigwedge\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}\n\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\\nv(\\exists x\\,\\varphi)=\n\\bigvee\\nolimits_{\\mathrm{WK}}\n\\{v(\\varphi(\\overline n)):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WK}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f\\land\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t\\lor\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf t\\land\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f\\lor\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false}],"bytes":3243,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d412b656b2bbda0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-weak-kleene]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-weak-kleene]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-se